  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - EARTHQUAKE MONITORING TECHNOLOGIES INITIATIVE, through Koeppen, Elliot &amp; Associates, Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $622,000 orientation visit initiative is designed to expose key Latin America and Caribbean officials to the latest U.S. technologies and best practices with respect to earthquake monitoring and communication systems. As illustrated by recent earthquakes in Chile and Haiti, the impact of such natural disasters can be tremendous and the modest investment in earthquake monitoring and communcations technologies could help to save hundreds, if not thousands, of lives, while at the same time generating new opportunities for the sale of U.S. goods and services.</narrative>
  </description>
